         [[b'a', b'b']]], dtype=object)


  Batched indexing into a 3-tensor:

  >>> tf.gather_nd(
  ...     indices = [[[1]], [[0]]],
  ...     params = [[['a0', 'b0'], ['c0', 'd0']],
  ...               [['a1', 'b1'], ['c1', 'd1']]]).numpy()
  array([[[[b'a1', b'b1'],
